[00:56.21] Restrained am I
[00:59.19] By a pair of ether chains
[01:03.09] Restless I abide
[01:06.40] In the realm where once I reigned
[01:09.92] I walk into a dream land
[01:13.11] Unto which no god has prevailed
[01:16.38] In the wildest dreams of my heresy
[01:19.43] The fantasy is unchained
[01:23.63] A realm,
[01:25.28] forgotten by all the mortal minds
[01:30.19] Where the ancient stars adorned the skies
[01:33.47] Rekindling the ebony flames
[02:44.21] As the night crawls in,
[02:46.07] sets loose the beasts within
[02:48.21] Clad in a silken cape,
[02:50.18] she claims all the landscape
[02:52.28] All apparitions stand by,
[02:54.27] in her embrace they all thrive
[03:13.90] In the vaguest corners
[03:16.09] of the mortal minds they lived
[03:19.14] Bestowing powers on those
[03:21.93] whom in themselves believed
[03:25.30] In the darkest depths
[03:27.87] of the Dreaming they thrive
[03:31.89] Upon the dismal wastes
[03:34.09] of imagination they find life
[03:53.71] Floating in the vast fields of infinite Cosmos
[03:57.12] I breathe the very essence of the true Chaos
[04:00.91] Ivory bells ring for my return in a somber chime
[04:04.69] Through the endless and ruthless chasm of time
[04:08.74] I dream…
[05:05.03] All was hidden
[05:07.45] Beyond a velvet ebon face
[05:11.50] As bright as blackened stars
[05:15.00] And the pearls beneath the crystal lakes
[05:18.79] I take a step
[05:22.17] Set loose the grief I breed within
[05:26.31] My Mistress waits for me
[05:29.52] Impatiently beyond the Grieving Gates…